msgstr "On a boosted trip the meet-up, ETAs and SOS sit on all {count} lock screens and in the Dynamic Island. It switches off at midnight on the last day."

#: ../../apps/mobile/src/features/trip/live-activities/lock-screen-offer/offer-copy.ts
